# The release archive (`composer install --prefer-dist`, the GitHub zip of a tag) carries
# the library, the contract's copy, the gateway's vectors and the mock gateway, which the
# plugins use from vendor/ (their end-to-end tests and their copy of the contract). It
# leaves out what only this repository's own development needs.
/tests export-ignore
/.claude export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/mock-gateway/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/phpunit.xml.dist export-ignore
